WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:02.514
Installation

2
00:00:02.514 --> 00:00:05.098
Open Settings → Community plugins

3
00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:07.374
Turn off restricted mode

4
00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:14.112
Browse and search for BRAT

5
00:00:14.112 --> 00:00:24.211
Install it, then enable it

6
00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:30.327
Run BRAT: Add a beta plugin for testing

7
00:00:30.327 --> 00:00:35.487
Enter the repository sblabkribb/labnoteo

8
00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:40.529
Pick latest under Select a version

9
00:00:40.529 --> 00:00:43.262
Press Add plugin to install and enable it

10
00:00:43.262 --> 00:00:45.624
Waiting (fast-forward)

11
00:00:45.624 --> 00:00:53.288
Workflows and Samples icons appear in the ribbon
